Command your Temporal Hounds to breathe time, dealing [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal damage and reducing the three highest stats of all targets in a radius [4, 5, 5, 6, 6 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] cone.

Affected targets will have their stats reduced by [11, 13, 16, 17, 19 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] for 3 turns.  You are immune to the breath of your own hounds and your hounds are immune to stat damage from other hounds.

When you learn this talent, your hounds gain [10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] temporal damage affinity.
